{"unit_id":"JasonWei04__dsh-computer-use#card-zh","repo":"JasonWei04/dsh-computer-use","commit":"6b2739adb25287c20f034d77ec63dcd0d99c10a1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的电脑操作插件，通过工具接入截图、录屏分析和真实桌面控制。它注册状态查询、截图、短时录屏、单步操作和自主任务循环，并提供设置区配置视觉服务。用户可让视觉模型识别屏幕元素与坐标，再执行点击、输入、滚动、启动或切换窗口等动作；循环模式会依据画面决策下一步并重复观察。适合需要让 DSH 在 Windows 桌面上完成界面操作或观察动态过程的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:613-628","index.js:866-1230"]}
{"unit_id":"JasonWei04__dsh-computer-use#card-en","repo":"JasonWei04/dsh-computer-use","commit":"6b2739adb25287c20f034d77ec63dcd0d99c10a1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-computer-use adds screenshot, recording, desktop action, and task-loop tools to DSH Web. It sends screen images to a vision model, then can click, type, scroll, launch programs, and manage windows on Windows. The loop observes results and chooses follow-up actions.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:613-628","index.js:866-1230"]}
